WEBVTT

1
00:00.000 --> 00:03.600
Ana eats 1/2 of a pizza. Shade 1 of 2 equal parts.

2
00:03.600 --> 00:07.200
Ben eats 2/4 of the same pizza. Shade 2 of 4 parts.

3
00:07.200 --> 00:10.400
Now 4/8. Shade 4 of 8 parts.

4
00:10.400 --> 00:13.200
The shaded parts are the same length!

5
00:13.200 --> 00:17.933
1/2 = 2/4 = 4/8. They are equivalent fractions.
